:''Not to be confused with [[Brainwashed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Gross Cat]].''
'''Malevolent Macho Leg Cat''' is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy that appears in [[Devilish Strides (Merciless)|The Malevolent Gross]]. He was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Malevolent Macho Leg Cat
|image = E 663.png
|first appearance = [[Devilish Strides (Merciless)|The Malevolent Gross]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Malevolent Macho Leg Cat is a very powerful pusher. Think of it as [[Manic Macho Legs (Enemy)|Manic Macho Legs]]/[[Crazed Gross Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Gross Cat]], but trades wave for surge and has a much higher money drop. This enemy is also very bulky, having only 2 knockbacks and a high 600,000 health. Its range is very short, however.

==Strategy==
As you can't rely on the strategy you would use against [[Manic Macho Legs (Enemy)|Manic Macho Legs]] (just keep knocking them back before they wave), and there isn't any real equivalent to [[Wave Shield]] for Surge Attacks, it is recommended you use [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge Immune Units]] such as [[Talents|Talented]] [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]], Talented [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]]. Any unit that isn't Surge Immune, tanky, and has below 600 range WILL be annihilated.

